<title>USA: Access Beyond to merge with Hayes.</title>
<headline>Access Beyond to merge with Hayes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Beyond Inc and privately-held Hayes Microcomputer Products Inc said Wednesday they had agreed to merge in a stock swap.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Access Beyond will issue about 45 million common shares in exchange for all outstanding shares of Hayes.</p>
<p>Access Beyond will be renamed Hayes Communications Inc, and its stock will continue to be traded on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>On completion of the merger, Access Beyond shareholders will own about 21 percent of the new company's outstanding shares.</p>
